SUMMARY:Journey of Emotions
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a unique sensory experience\, where the holiday transforms into a world you can see\, hear\, smell and taste. From Saudi Arabia to Amman\, from Uzbekistan to Indonesia and Morocco\, a journey that blends art\, the senses and memories\, you are welcome to wander through rooms\, each of which captures a different aspect of the holiday atmosphere&mdash\;from its joyful sounds and unique scents to its traditional sweets and dishes and even its colorful attire. Click here to join the virtual queue.
